# Private explicit-window watch execution. Automatic scheduling is unavailable.
[execution]
enabled = <boolean>
* false by default. Global opt-in is separate from binding enablement.
* An authenticated admin/sc_admin with adm_investigate must own the baseline.
* A trusted, qualified complete provider is required; none is shipped.
* No configuration value selects Python code, source queries or credentials.
* No saved search, notification or infrastructure action is enabled.
